-- What the skill window knows about a skill: its icon, name, levels, SP and
-- range, and what it needs. One row per skill this mod adds or changes; a
-- row replaces the client's whole row for that skill.
--
-- The first value names the icon: the client draws <it>.bmp from the item
-- folder of its interface textures. A stock skill's name borrows that
-- skill's icon, so a mod needs no image of its own.
